#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:2
msgid "Selection and rearrangement"
msgstr "選取與重新排列"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:4
msgid ""
"Reductions collapsed an array down to a scalar or a lower-rank result. "
"Selection covers the operations that pick *which* elements survive and "
"*where* they end up: conditional choice, clipping, sorting, looking up "
"indices, reordering along an axis."
msgstr ""
"歸約運算會把陣列收合成純量或更低階的結果。選取則涵蓋了那些決定 *哪些* 元素得以保留以及它們 *落在何處* "
"的運算：條件式選擇、裁剪、排序、查找索引，以及沿著某個軸重新排序。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:11
msgid "Conditional choice"
msgstr "條件式選擇"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:13
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.where` returns an array that takes elements from ``x`` where "
"the condition is truthy and from ``y`` otherwise. The three operands "
"broadcast together::"
msgstr ""
":func:`~numpy.where` 會傳回一個陣列：在條件為真的位置取 ``x`` 的元素，否則取 ``y`` "
"的元素。這三個運算元會一起進行廣播::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:22
msgid ""
"This is the right tool for an \"if/else per element\" without writing a "
"Python loop."
msgstr "這是實作「逐元素 if/else」而不需撰寫 Python 迴圈的合適工具。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:25
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.clip` is shorthand for ``maximum(lo, minimum(a, hi))`` -- "
"saturate the values to a range::"
msgstr ""
":func:`~numpy.clip` 是 ``maximum(lo, minimum(a, hi))`` 的簡寫——將數值飽和限制在某個範圍內::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:32
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.maximum` and :func:`~numpy.minimum` take two operands and "
"return the element-wise larger / smaller::"
msgstr ""
":func:`~numpy.maximum` 與 :func:`~numpy.minimum` 接受兩個運算元，並逐元素傳回較大／較小者::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:40
msgid "Finding indices"
msgstr "查找索引"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:42
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.nonzero` returns the coordinates of every non-zero element, "
"split into one index array per dimension. For a 2-D input the result is a "
"tuple of two arrays: the first holds the row indices, the second holds the "
"column indices. Pairing them column-wise gives the ``(row, col)`` of each "
"non-zero position::"
msgstr ""
":func:`~numpy.nonzero` 會傳回每個非零元素的座標，並依維度各自拆分為一個索引陣列。對於二維輸入，其結果是一個包含兩個陣列的 "
"tuple：第一個保存列索引，第二個保存欄索引。將它們逐欄配對，即可得到每個非零位置的 ``(row, col)``::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:54
msgid ""
"The non-zero entries in ``m`` are ``m[0, 1] = 2`` and ``m[1, 0] = 3``. The "
"first returned array ``[0, 1]`` gives their row indices; the second ``[1, "
"0]`` gives their column indices. Reading the two arrays side by side "
"recovers the positions ``(0, 1)`` and ``(1, 0)``."
msgstr ""
"``m`` 中的非零項目為 ``m[0, 1] = 2`` 和 ``m[1, 0] = 3``\\ 。傳回的第一個陣列 ``[0, 1]`` "
"給出它們的列索引；第二個陣列 ``[1, 0]`` 給出它們的欄索引。並排讀取這兩個陣列即可還原出位置 ``(0, 1)`` 與 ``(1, "
"0)``\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:60
msgid "Two reductions also produce indices:"
msgstr "另有兩個歸約運算也會產生索引："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:62
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.argmin` / :func:`~numpy.argmax` -- index of the smallest / "
"largest element."
msgstr ":func:`~numpy.argmin` / :func:`~numpy.argmax` -- 最小／最大元素的索引。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:65
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.argsort` -- an integer array that would sort the input along "
"the given axis (defaults to the last)::"
msgstr ":func:`~numpy.argsort` -- 一個整數陣列，能將輸入沿著給定的軸（預設為最後一個軸）排序::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:73
msgid ""
"``argsort`` always returns ``uint16``; the array being sorted must therefore"
" have no more than 65,535 elements on the sorted axis."
msgstr "``argsort`` 一律傳回 ``uint16``\\ ；因此被排序的陣列在其排序軸上的元素個數不得超過 65,535 個。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:77
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.bincount` counts occurrences of each non-negative integer in a"
" 1-D ``uint8`` / ``uint16`` input::"
msgstr ":func:`~numpy.bincount` 會計算一維 ``uint8`` / ``uint16`` 輸入中每個非負整數出現的次數::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:84
msgid ""
"Useful for building histograms of small-integer pixel values without writing"
" a Python loop."
msgstr "在不撰寫 Python 迴圈的情況下，可用於建立小整數像素值的直方圖。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:88
msgid "Sorting and reordering"
msgstr "排序與重新排序"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:90
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.sort` returns a sorted copy of the array along the given axis "
"(the last by default). Use :meth:`~numpy.ndarray.sort` on the array directly"
" for an in-place version::"
msgstr ""
":func:`~numpy.sort` 會沿著給定的軸（預設為最後一個軸）傳回陣列已排序的副本。若要原地排序，請直接對陣列使用 "
":meth:`~numpy.ndarray.sort`::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:98
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.flip` reverses the order along the given axis (every axis when"
" no ``axis`` is passed)::"
msgstr ":func:`~numpy.flip` 會沿著給定的軸反轉順序（未傳入 ``axis`` 時則反轉所有軸）::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:104
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.roll` cyclically shifts elements by the given count. Useful "
"for implementing a ring-buffer-style shift register::"
msgstr ":func:`~numpy.roll` 會依給定的計數循環地位移元素。可用於實作環形緩衝區式的移位暫存器::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:111
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.take` is the explicit form of fancy indexing -- pick elements "
"at arbitrary indices::"
msgstr ":func:`~numpy.take` 是花式索引（fancy indexing）的明確形式——可挑選任意索引位置的元素::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:119
msgid "Filtering and structural edits"
msgstr "過濾與結構性編輯"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:121
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.compress` is the explicit form of boolean indexing -- return "
"the slices of ``a`` selected by the boolean condition::"
msgstr ":func:`~numpy.compress` 是布林索引的明確形式——傳回 ``a`` 中由布林條件選出的切片::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:129
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.delete` returns a copy with the entries at the given indices "
"removed::"
msgstr ":func:`~numpy.delete` 會傳回一個移除了給定索引處項目的副本::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:136
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.diff` returns the n-th discrete forward difference of the "
"array along an axis. Used to compute first-order changes between adjacent "
"samples::"
msgstr ":func:`~numpy.diff` 會沿著某個軸傳回陣列的第 n 階離散前向差分。用於計算相鄰樣本之間的一階變化量::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:145
msgid "What each operation costs"
msgstr "各項運算的成本"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:147
msgid ""
"Almost every function on this page returns a freshly allocated array. Two "
"exceptions:"
msgstr "本頁中幾乎每個函式都會傳回一個全新配置的陣列。有兩個例外："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:150
msgid ""
":meth:`~numpy.ndarray.sort` sorts in place; the free function "
":func:`~numpy.sort` returns a sorted copy."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~numpy.ndarray.sort` 會原地排序；而自由函式 :func:`~numpy.sort` 則傳回已排序的副本。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:153
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.take` accepts an ``out=`` keyword to write into a buffer that "
"already exists."
msgstr ":func:`~numpy.take` 接受一個 ``out=`` 關鍵字，可將結果寫入一個已經存在的緩衝區。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:156
msgid ""
"In a loop that runs many times a second, prefer the in-place "
":meth:`~numpy.ndarray.sort` and reuse pre-allocated buffers everywhere else."
" Boolean masks themselves are allocated every time the comparison runs -- "
"build a mask once and reuse it across operations rather than rebuilding it "
"inside every iteration."
msgstr ""
"在每秒執行多次的迴圈中，請優先使用原地的 :meth:`~numpy.ndarray.sort`\\ "
"，並在其他所有地方重複使用預先配置的緩衝區。布林遮罩本身在每次比較執行時都會被配置——請一次性建立遮罩並在各項運算間重複使用，而不要在每次迭代內重新建立它。"
